            ("Check the arithmetic", "Conversion is sign-ups divided by visits. Cost per sign-up is recorded spend divided by sign-ups, not a complete customer-acquisition cost. Include only relevant, consistently measured records. Use a weighted overall rate from totals rather than averaging channel percentages."),
            ("A recommendation needs limits", "The data is observational and audiences differ. A higher observed rate does not prove that moving budget will reproduce that rate. Attribution may overlap and long-term value is absent. Recommend a small controlled experiment or improved measurement rather than a guaranteed uplift."),
